.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Test that column spans are rendered, including in the header row, that the alignment of a cell spanning several
.# columns is set on its first column (which is the alignment it gets when parsed back), that invalid column spans
.# are ignored, and that the columns of a cell spanning several rows are kept free in the following rows (see table26)
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|=(% colspan="2" %)Name|=Age
|(% colspan="2" align="center" %)Peter Fox|(% align="right" %)42
|(% colspan="invalid" %)a|(% colspan="-1" %)b|(% colspan="0" %)c
|(% rowspan="2" %)d|e|f
|g|h
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|   Name    || Age |
| :--: | --- | --: |
| Peter Fox ||  42 |
|  a   |  b  |   c |
|  d   |  e  |   f |
|      |  g  |   h |
